
== 1. Maxwell-Betti corollary, Eq. (10) =================================
finite element  C_m = 0.0052083334
closed form     l^4/192EI = 0.0052083333
ratio                     = 1.00000002

-> the invariance constant really is the area under the deflected
   shape from a unit load at the sensor; on a bridge of unknown EI it
   can therefore be obtained from ONE static calibration test.

